<title>AUSTRALIA: Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last year.</title>
<headline>Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last year.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the year to April 11.</p>
<p>Top 10 largest gains in year</p>
<p>Rank Name			  Price     pct change</p>
<p>1   James Hardie		 3.67	     46.80</p>
<p>2   NAB			   16.04	     44.77</p>
<p>3   Howard Smith		10.30	     43.06</p>
<p>4   Fletcher Energy	    3.52	     40.80</p>
